#: taguette/templates/welcome.html:9
msgid ""
"<span><a href=\"https://help.libreqda.org/\">LibreQDA</a></span> is an "
"open-source web-based document tagging tool for qualitative data "
"analysis."
msgstr ""
"<span style=\"font-family:BadScript;\"><a "
"href=\"https://www.taguette.org/\">LibreQDA</a></span> adalah piranti "
"penandaan dokumen open-source berbasis web untuk analisis data "
"kualitatif."

#: taguette/templates/welcome.html:10
msgid ""
"Using this tool, you can upload a collection of documents, create a "
"hierarchy of codes, and annotate portions of documents with codes and "
"notes that you can recall and organize later."
msgstr ""
"Dengan alat ini, Anda dapat mengunggah kumpulan dokumen, membuat sebuah "
"hirarki tag, dan menandai bagian dari dokumen dengan tag dan catatan yang"
" dapat Anda buka dan atur kembali."

#: taguette/templates/welcome.html:12
#, python-format
